<https://w3id.org/cr>
  rdf:type owl:Ontology ;
  dc:bibliographicCitation "Cassandro, J., Hagedorn, P., Sigalov, K., Gatto, C., Mirarchi, C., Pavan, A., & König, M. (2025). Semantic Integration of Cost, Time and Geometry for a Resource-centred Perspective of Managing Construction Projects: . Proceedings of the 2025 European Conference on Computing in Construction. Publiziert. European Conference on Computing in Construction, Porto. https://doi.org/10.35490/ec3.2025.263" ;
